{"id":1040101,"chapter_id":1040101,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"地窟行动后·管理局办公室","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"玩家","content":"环研究院还是无法向MBCC提供关于狂厄结晶的相关信息？","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"speaker":"？？","content":"十分抱歉，目前的环研究院内，没有任何人能回答您的问题。","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_3"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":11,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"speaker":"玩家","content":"……","style":2,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"content":"作为狄斯知识的顶点，环研究院便是“无所不知”的代名词。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"content":"若是连环研究院也无法解释，你实在无法想象，那红色结晶到底是何种珍奇之物。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"speaker":"？？","content":"不过，在你的笼子里……有个人一定知道。","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":11,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"speaker":"？？","content":"要是没有有趣的发明，或是未知的理论，可没办法让她提起兴趣回答你的问题。","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":11,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"content":"他打开柜子，从里面拿出了一个像是魔方的物品。仔细看它的内部，似乎还放着什么东西。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"options":["这是什么？"],"style":6,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101010,"trial_step":10,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"这是什么？","goto":11}]},{"step":11,"speaker":"？？","content":"就当这是环研究院无法直接回答您问题的赔礼吧。","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":11,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"speaker":"？？","content":"拿上这个，她一定会给你一个满意的答案。","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":11,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"speaker":"？？","content":"时间到了。我们下次见，MBCC的局长。","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":11,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"content":"通讯被关闭，于此同时。管理局的信箱中，收到了一份来自环研究院的“神秘物品”。","style":3,"background":1040,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"content":"审查室内，夏音正头也不抬地摆弄着手中的魔方。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101016,"trial_step":16,"drawing":1040104},{"step":16,"speaker":"夏音","content":"嗯……？","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_17"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101018,"trial_step":18,"drawing":1040104},{"step":17,"content":"她眯着眼睛看了看棚顶的白炽灯，又看了看将灯打开的你，最后又将注意力放回手上。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101019,"trial_step":19,"drawing":1040106},{"step":18,"speaker":"夏音","content":"嗯……这次看来有望在十秒内全部复原呢，果然还是安静的环境合最合适。","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101020,"trial_step":20,"drawing":1040104},{"step":19,"speaker":"夏音","content":"R'#5-U-R'-U-R#5……","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_20"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101021,"trial_step":21,"drawing":1040104},{"step":20,"content":"你面前的少女快速地扭动着手中的魔方，口中念念有辞，似乎只把你当做飘进屋内的一缕烟雾。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101022,"trial_step":22,"drawing":1040104},{"step":21,"options":["我们能开始了么？","可以先停一下手上的事情么？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101023,"trial_step":23,"course":3,"drawing":1040105,"choices":[{"text":"我们能开始了么？","goto":24},{"text":"可以先停一下手上的事情么？","goto":26}]},{"step":22,"speaker":"夏音","content":"啊……啊，我都ok的。","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_23"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101024,"trial_step":24,"drawing":1040105},{"step":23,"speaker":"夏音","content":"快问完快结束吧。","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101025,"trial_step":25,"drawing":1040105,"next":[28]},{"step":24,"speaker":"夏音","content":"嗯……好啊。","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101026,"trial_step":26,"drawing":1040105},{"step":25,"speaker":"夏音","content":"这一面马上拼好……嗯，稍等我一下。","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101027,"trial_step":27,"drawing":1040105},{"step":26,"content":"她附和着你的话，盲拧着手上的十一阶魔方。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101028,"trial_step":28,"drawing":1040105},{"step":27,"content":"只消几秒，各异的色块便复归原位。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101029,"trial_step":29,"drawing":1040105},{"step":28,"content":"不愧是14岁便一路跳级进入环研究院的天才，第三高阶数的魔方对她来说也不过是小菜一碟。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101030,"trial_step":30,"drawing":1040106},{"step":29,"content":"你翻阅着夏音的研究论文，准备找出一些能够向她提问的东西。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101031,"trial_step":31,"drawing":1040106},{"step":30,"content":"《浅论结晶环物质蓄电池组设计问题及解决方案》、《环物质余热排除过程的模拟计算论》、《对环物质的次阶熵变计算研究》……","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101032,"trial_step":32,"drawing":1040106},{"step":31,"content":"每一个文字，每一项研究，都是与危险与未知相伴。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101033,"trial_step":33,"drawing":1040106},{"step":32,"content":"她使用的研究材料，全是都是性状最不稳定，也是最接近本源状态的环物质。一旦失误，整个环研究院可能就会被夷为平地。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101034,"trial_step":34,"drawing":1040106},{"step":33,"content":"但夏音竟与这些危险到不能再危险的东西打了三年的交道。也不怪有传言说，比起“研究院的天才”这一称号，<color=#fb9259>疯狂科学家</color>或是<color=#fb9259>禁忌探秘者</color>更适合她。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101035,"trial_step":35,"drawing":1040106},{"step":34,"content":"测试音效的打断逻辑","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":36,"course":6,"drawing":1040106},{"step":35,"content":"播放一个长音效，会有个前奏，稍等一会儿。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":36,"course":6,"drawing":1040106},{"step":36,"content":"播放相同音效，会继续延续。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":36,"course":6,"drawing":1040106},{"step":37,"content":"暂停配置音效，这里测试一下打断。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":36,"course":6,"drawing":1040106},{"step":38,"content":"播放一个稍短的音效，在这里等待它结束。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":36,"course":6,"drawing":1040106},{"step":39,"content":"配置同名音效，看能否再次播放。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":36,"course":6,"drawing":1040106},{"step":40,"content":"结束测试。","style":18,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":36,"course":6,"drawing":1040106},{"step":41,"content":"熟悉它么？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101037,"trial_step":37,"drawing":1040106},{"step":42,"content":"夏音扫了一眼这散发着不祥光芒的武器便立刻给了你答案。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101038,"trial_step":38,"drawing":1040104},{"step":43,"speaker":"夏音","content":"当然，这是量产轻型狂厄武器Ⅱ号的改良型，威力一般。甚至，打不穿你面前的那扇门。","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101039,"trial_step":39,"drawing":1040104},{"step":44,"speaker":"夏音","content":"我说完了，该放我走了吧？","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101040,"trial_step":40,"drawing":1040105},{"step":45,"content":"夏音迫不及待地想从这椅子上离开，仿佛是有什么要紧的急事一般。但你的问询才刚刚开始。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101041,"trial_step":41,"drawing":1040105},{"step":46,"options":["那它上面的那块东西呢？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101042,"trial_step":42,"course":3,"drawing":1040105,"choices":[{"text":"那它上面的那块东西呢？","goto":43}]},{"step":47,"content":"你指了指武器上的凹槽，在那上面本应有一块结晶，但你为了安全，提前将其卸下了。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101043,"trial_step":43,"drawing":1040105},{"step":48,"speaker":"夏音","content":"……我不知道你对那块脏东西有什么特别的爱好。","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_42"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101044,"trial_step":44,"drawing":1040105},{"step":49,"speaker":"夏音","content":"但如果只是想知道它的参数，还是问环研究院的那些家伙最快。","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_43"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101045,"trial_step":45,"drawing":1040105},{"step":50,"content":"他们并不知道。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101046,"trial_step":46,"drawing":1040105},{"step":51,"speaker":"夏音","content":"都过去那么久了，他们怎么还没研究出个所以然来。","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_45"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101047,"trial_step":47,"drawing":1040105},{"step":52,"speaker":"夏音","content":"唉……他们的效率还是一如既往地让人失望。","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_46"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101048,"trial_step":48,"drawing":1040105},{"step":53,"options":["可以向我介绍一下这种结晶么？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101049,"trial_step":49,"course":3,"drawing":1040105,"choices":[{"text":"可以向我介绍一下这种结晶么？","goto":50}]},{"step":54,"content":"我看你的论文里也有不少关于它的论述。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101050,"trial_step":50,"drawing":1040105},{"step":55,"speaker":"夏音","content":"不可以。","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_49"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101051,"trial_step":51,"drawing":1040104},{"step":56,"speaker":"夏音","content":"因为我现在就是个学生，这么高深的事情……一个学生可不知道。","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_50"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101052,"trial_step":52,"drawing":1040104},{"step":57,"speaker":"夏音","content":"我觉得，你现在该给一个学生的，只是一点自由。","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_51"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101053,"trial_step":53,"drawing":1040104},{"step":58,"speaker":"夏音","content":"你说对吧？局长？","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_52"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101054,"trial_step":54,"drawing":1040104},{"step":59,"content":"这根本不是你占主导的常规审查，这位科学巨擘就差把“放我离开”几个字写在脸上，偏偏你却拿她又没什么办法。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101055,"trial_step":55,"drawing":1040104},{"step":60,"content":"她不想就你的问题深入讨论，只是在一味地敷衍你，告诉你一些无关紧要的信息。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101056,"trial_step":56,"drawing":1040104},{"step":61,"content":"<color=#fb9259>“没有能让她感兴趣的东西可不行。”</color>","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101057,"trial_step":57,"drawing":1040104},{"step":62,"content":"<color=#fb9259>“要么是她见所未见过的伟大发现，要么就是这个。”</color>","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101058,"trial_step":58,"drawing":1040104},{"step":63,"content":"男人的话语在你的脑海中