家","content":"空间不太够？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101145,"trial_step":145,"drawing":1040108},{"step":153,"speaker":"夏音","content":"嗯……我看看，至少还需要这么一大——块黑板吧。","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_144"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101146,"trial_step":146,"drawing":1040108},{"step":154,"speaker":"玩家","content":"你要干什么？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101147,"trial_step":147,"drawing":1040108},{"step":155,"speaker":"夏音","content":"当然是先给画它的晶体结构了。","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_146"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101148,"trial_step":148,"drawing":1040108},{"step":156,"speaker":"玩家","content":"……倒也不用那么详细。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101149,"trial_step":149,"drawing":1040108},{"step":157,"speaker":"玩家","content":"我只需要清楚狂厄结晶，黑环，还有禁闭者的关系就够了。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101150,"trial_step":150,"drawing":1040108,"next":[154]},{"step":158,"speaker":"夏音","content":"要多笼统？知道它的反应性？极性？生物活性？相态？还是什么其他的东西？","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_149"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101151,"trial_step":151,"drawing":1040109},{"step":159,"content":"听着夏音的言语，你似乎有一种眩晕感。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101152,"trial_step":152,"drawing":1040109},{"step":160,"speaker":"玩家","content":"那些都不用，我只需要清楚狂厄结晶，黑环，还有禁闭者的关系就好。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101153,"trial_step":153,"drawing":1040109},{"step":161,"speaker":"夏音","content":"嗯……好吧。我想想……要怎么给你演示更形象一点。","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_152"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101154,"trial_step":154,"drawing":1040108},{"step":162,"speaker":"夏音","content":"对了！就用这个吧！","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_153"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101155,"trial_step":155,"drawing":1040108},{"step":163,"content":"夏音伸手拿来了放在桌子上的冰水。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101156,"trial_step":156,"drawing":1040108},{"step":164,"speaker":"夏音","content":"你有那把武器，就一定去过那个地窟，对吧？我们就把地窟环境当做是这盛水的杯子好了。","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_155"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101157,"trial_step":157,"drawing":1040102},{"step":165,"speaker":"夏音","content":"如果持续降温，杯子中的冰会越来越多。同理……如果地窟里的污染程度越高，存在的环物质便越多。","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_156"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101158,"trial_step":158,"drawing":1040102},{"step":166,"speaker":"夏音","content":"狂厄结晶也不是什么常见的晶体，它们是环物质在吸收禁闭者的精神能量后所生成的晶体。","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_157"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101159,"trial_step":159,"drawing":1040109},{"step":167,"options":["狂厄结晶又是如何影响禁闭者的？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101160,"trial_step":160,"course":3,"drawing":1040109,"choices":[{"text":"狂厄结晶又是如何影响禁闭者的？","goto":161}]},{"step":168,"speaker":"夏音","content":"你应该知道……狂厄的本质是精神暴走。","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_159"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101161,"trial_step":161,"drawing":1040109},{"step":169,"speaker":"夏音","content":"看不见摸不着的精神能量被投射到我们的现实世界，成了一种“物质”。","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_160"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101162,"trial_step":162,"drawing":1040109},{"step":170,"speaker":"夏音","content":"那些尖刺、污染、异形形变都是如此。","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_161"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101163,"trial_step":163,"drawing":1040109},{"step":171,"options":["就和我在地窟见到的东西一样？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101164,"trial_step":164,"course":3,"drawing":1040109,"choices":[{"text":"就和我在地窟见到的东西一样？","goto":165}]},{"step":172,"speaker":"夏音","content":"对，环物质是一种特殊的污染。","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_163"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101165,"trial_step":165,"drawing":1040109},{"step":173,"speaker":"夏音","content":"它与一般有着强烈暴走意志的精神污染不同……我没有找到环物质到底来自“谁”。","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_164"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101166,"trial_step":166,"drawing":1040109},{"step":174,"speaker":"夏音","content":"相反，它像一种空白的催化剂，只会放大催化其他人的意志。","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_165"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101167,"trial_step":167,"drawing":1040109},{"step":175,"speaker":"夏音","content":"于是，在特定条件下，环物质会与禁闭者的暴走精神共鸣，像复印机一样，变成具象化的暴走意识体。","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_166"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101168,"trial_step":168,"drawing":1040109},{"step":176,"speaker":"夏音","content":"所谓的狂厄结晶，就是通过复制禁闭者情绪波动制造出来的精神结晶，也是便携式的精神力量发生器。","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_167"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101169,"trial_step":169,"drawing":1040109},{"step":177,"options":["那帕尔马实验室……"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101170,"trial_step":170,"course":3,"drawing":1040109,"choices":[{"text":"那帕尔马实验室……","goto":171}]},{"step":178,"speaker":"玩家","content":"我在那里见过很多这种东西。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101171,"trial_step":171,"drawing":1040109},{"step":179,"speaker":"夏音","content":"没错，那里恐怕就是通过试验刺激禁闭者的精神，逼迫他们长时间暴走来延长共鸣时间，获取他们中意的禁闭者能力。","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_170"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101172,"trial_step":172,"drawing":1040109},{"step":180,"speaker":"夏音","content":"我在暗网上了解过，那个叫九十九的，恐怕就是在辛迪加卖得最好的狂暴战斗能力者之一吧。","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_171"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101173,"trial_step":173,"drawing":1040109},{"step":181,"content":"她说得没错，因为辛迪加人靠武力说话，而九十九又是极端武力的代名词，成为抢手货只是时间问题。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101174,"trial_step":174,"drawing":1040109},{"step":182,"content":"你回忆起了九十九负伤时的样子，在力量之下，不知埋藏了多少苦痛。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101175,"trial_step":175,"drawing":1040109},{"step":183,"content":"但……帕尔马的技术又是从何而来呢，明明辛迪加的条件无比恶劣，狂厄结晶的提纯也无比困难。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101176,"trial_step":176,"drawing":1040109},{"step":184,"content":"辛迪加的狂厄武器却在一个时间点快速膨胀，这没有外力的帮助是很难做到的。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101177,"trial_step":177,"drawing":1040109},{"step":185,"content":"狂厄结晶便是由环物质演变而来，而夏音却和他们有着密不可分的关系。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101178,"trial_step":178,"drawing":1040109},{"step":186,"options":["那狂厄武器和你的武器有什么区别？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101179,"trial_step":179,"course":3,"drawing":1040109,"choices":[{"text":"那狂厄武器和你的武器有什么区别？","goto":180}]},{"step":187,"content":"你移开视线，看向被放在墙角的无人机们。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101180,"trial_step":180,"drawing":1040109},{"step":188,"content":"它们的外形，驱动……都非常巧合地相像。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101181,"trial_step":181,"drawing":1040109},{"step":189,"speaker":"夏音","content":"他们完全不是一种东西！局长，你不要把我独一无二的发明和这些量产的缺陷品相比啊！","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_180"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101182,"trial_step":182,"drawing":1040108},{"step":190,"speaker":"夏音","content":"唔……这些抄作业的坏家伙，居然敢抄到我夏音的头上来……","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_181"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101183,"trial_step":183,"drawing":1040108},{"step":191,"speaker":"夏音","content":"他们根本就不理解我辛辛苦苦研究出来的环物质第二定理，居然做出这么垃圾的东西……","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_182"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101184,"trial_step":184,"drawing":1040108},{"step":192,"content":"眼见夏音要进入状态，要继续说关于环物质的话题，你急忙转移话题。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101185,"trial_step":185,"drawing":1040108},{"step":193,"options":["这里还有一样东西要给你看"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101186,"trial_step":186,"course":3,"drawing":1040103,"choices":[{"text":"这里还有一样东西要给你看","goto":187}]},{"step":194,"speaker":"夏音","content":"嗯？是什么？是第二部剧场版么！记得当初它们就画了个草稿——","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_185"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101187,"trial_step":187,"drawing":1040103},{"step":195,"content":"你摇摇头，将一份文件交给夏音。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101188,"trial_step":188,"drawing":1040103},{"step":196,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":189,"course":6,"drawing":1040103},{"step":197,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":189,"course":6,"drawing":1040103},{"step":198,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置3","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":189,"course":6,"drawing":1040103},{"step":199,"options":["选择1"],"jump":[5],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":189,"course":6,"drawing":1040103},{"step":200,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置4","style":18,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":189,"course":6,"drawing":1040103},{"step":201,"options":["选择1","选择2"],"jump":[7,9],"style":4,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":189,"course":6,"drawing":1040103},{"step":202,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":189,"course":6,"drawing":1040103},{"step":203,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":189,"course":6,"drawing":1040103},{"step":204,"content":"夏音举起文件，眯起眼睛端详着破碎的文字。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101190,"trial_step":190,"drawing":1040109},{"step":205,"speaker":"夏音","content":"这是什么……嗯？救命？","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_189"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101191,"trial_step":191,"drawing":1040109},{"step":206,"speaker":"夏音","content":"有个疯子正在袭击实验室……快来救我？","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_190"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101192,"trial_step":192,"drawing":1040109},{"step":207,"speaker":"夏音","content":"你这是想要带我出任务么，局长？啊——今天不行不行，我的体力只够我走回房间了。","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_191"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101193,"trial_step":193,"drawing":1040109},{"step":208,"options":["这是一封帕尔马的求救信"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101194,"trial_step":194,"course":3,"drawing":1040109,"choices":[{"text":"这是一封帕尔马的求救信","goto":195}]},{"step":209,"content":"据说这里发生了一次大爆炸，并且是由狂厄武器所导致的大爆炸。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101195,"trial_step":195,"drawing":1040109},{"step":210,"content":"照片上荒芜的帕尔马中，正闪烁着贯穿天际的耀光。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101196,"trial_step":196,"drawing":1040109},{"step":211,"content":"你知道这件事么？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101197,"trial_step":197,"drawing":1040109},{"step":212,"speaker":"夏音","content":"咳，很可惜！夏音老师的答疑到这里就结束了！","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_196"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101198,"trial_step":198,"drawing":1040102},{"step":213,"speaker":"夏音","content":"已经7点58了，我最喜欢的真面侠盗要开播了。来之前你可是说会按时放我走的。","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_197"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101199,"trial_step":199,"drawing":1040102},{"step":214,"speaker":"夏音","content":"回答时间结束，下一次咨询，要带第二集来哦。","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_198"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101200,"trial_step":200,"drawing":1040102},{"step":215,"speaker":"夏音","content":"哦对啦，要是想讨论动画的话，这边随时欢迎哦——","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_199"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101201,"trial_step":201,"drawing":1040102},{"step":216,"content":"看来这位天才又耍起了性子。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101202,"trial_step":202,"drawing":1040102},{"step":217,"content":"你叹了口气，打开了审查室的大门。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101203,"trial_step":203,"drawing":1040102},{"step":218,"speaker":"夏音","content":"特摄——我来了——","voice":["vo_trial_40101_1_202"],"voice_bank":"vo_xiayin_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101204,"trial_step":204,"drawing":1040102},{"step":219,"content":"夏音在无人机的帮助下，飞一样地溜出了审查室。","style":14,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":140101205,"trial_step":205,"drawing":1040102}]}